    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dicey Chess</strong> is a chess game in which the throw of the die decides how far you can move, adding a layer of unpredictability to every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892190/extras/dc986e22a81c91e5b8e578f3a461017a.poster.avif?t=1741645304\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892190/extras/dc986e22a81c91e5b8e578f3a461017a.webm?t=1741645304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highly Customizable</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Die Ranges</strong>: Make the pawn be able to walk between 1 and 3 or even 1 and 7 cells by modifying its die.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Piece Types</strong>: Randomize the types of pieces you will be playing with. You could end up with 10 rooks or even 5 kings requiring your enemy to capture all of them to win.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Piece Movements</strong>: Randomize the way your pieces can move. Have the pawn move like a knight or the rook like a bishop. Even combinations are possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn Timer</strong>: Set your own pace with customizable turn timers. Or if you are feeling lucky you can also randomize it!</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Anywhere</strong>: Challenge friends online or over a local network, or go up  against a powerful Bot.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dicey Chess</strong> is a chess game in which the throw of the die decides how far you can move, adding a layer of unpredictability to every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892190/extras/dc986e22a81c91e5b8e578f3a461017a.poster.avif?t=1741645304\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892190/extras/dc986e22a81c91e5b8e578f3a461017a.webm?t=1741645304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highly Customizable</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Die Ranges</strong>: Make the pawn be able to walk between 1 and 3 or even 1 and 7 cells by modifying its die.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Piece Types</strong>: Randomize the types of pieces you will be playing with. You could end up with 10 rooks or even 5 kings requiring your enemy to capture all of them to win.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Piece Movements</strong>: Randomize the way your pieces can move. Have the pawn move like a knight or the rook like a bishop. Even combinations are possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn Timer</strong>: Set your own pace with customizable turn timers. Or if you are feeling lucky you can also randomize it!</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Anywhere</strong>: Challenge friends online or over a local network, or go up  against a powerful Bot.</p></li></ul>",
